 favorites: 2; remixes: 0.\nTags: pricing, section, animated, cta, billing.\n## Overview\nNexus Intelligence Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\n\nNexus. Platform Solutions Resources Pricing Start building Intelligence that scales with your ambition A unified platform designed for complex workflows. Leave disjointed tools behind and give your team a singular cogni…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Intelligence that scales with your ambition.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #967455, secondary #3A3530, accent #FFF176, background #967455, surface #3A3530, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexus - Intelligence Platform</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <style>\n        /* Essential inline styles for specific effects not easily done with utility classes */\n        body {\n            background-color: #2A2420; /* Fallback for canvas */\n            margin: 0;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n        }\n        .noise-bg {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100vw;\n            height: 100vh;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: -1;\n            opacity: 0.4;\n            background-image: url(\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noiseFilter'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.8' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noiseFilter)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E\");\n        }\n        canvas#bg-lines {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100vw;\n            height: 100vh;\n            z-index: -2;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n        /* Hide scrollbar for cleaner look */\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 0px; background: transparent; }\n\n        .masked-word {\n            display: inline-block;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            vertical-align: bottom;\n        }\n        .masked-word-inner {\n            display: inline-block;\n            transform: translateY(100%);\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"font-sans antialiased text-[#3A3530] selection:bg-[#967455]/30\">\n\n    <!-- Background Layers -->\n    <canvas id=\"bg-lines\"></canvas>\n    <div class=\"noise-bg\" style=\"background-image: url('https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/f5347579-34d0-43b9-99d3-126f6193d19d_3840w.jpg');\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Wrapper constrained to act like the frame over the background -->\n    <div class=\"w-full min-h-screen p-4 md:p-8 lg:p-12 flex justify-center\">\n\n        <!-- Premium Central Surface -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-[1280px] bg-[#F9F8F6] rounded-sm shadow-[0_2.8px_2.2px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.034),_0_6.7px_5.3px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.048),_0_12.5px_10px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.06),_0_22.3px_17.9px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.072),_0_41.8px_33.4px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.086),_0_100px_80px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.12)] overflow-hidden flex flex-col\">\n\n            <!-- Subtle Framed Grid Overlay -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0\">\n                <!-- Vertical Guides -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-6 md:left-12 lg:left-24 border-r border-[#E5E3DD]/60\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 right-6 md:right-12 lg:right-24 border-l border-[#E5E3DD]/60\"></div>\n                <!-- Subtle diagonal texture line -->\n                <svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full opacity-[0.02]\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                    <defs>\n                        <pattern id=\"diagonal\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45 0 0)\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n                            <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>\n                        </pattern>\n                    </defs>\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"url(#diagonal)\"></rect>\n                </svg>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Navigation -->\n            <header class=\"relative z-10 w-full px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-24 py-8 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#E5E3DD]/40\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 group\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:asterisk-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-[#3A3530] group-hover:rotate-90 transition-transform duration-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-xl tracking-tight font-medium\">Nexus.</span>\n                </a>\n\n                <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#68635C] hover:text-[#3A3530] transition-colors\">Platform</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#68635C] hover:text-[#3A3530] transition-colors\">Solutions</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#68635C] hover:text-[#3A3530] transition-colors\">Resources</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#68635C] hover:text-[#3A3530] transition-colors\">Pricing</a>\n                </nav>\n\n                <button class=\"bg-[#3A3530] text-[#F9F8F6] px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-[#25221F] transition-colors shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">\n                    Start building\n                </button>\n            </header>\n\n            <!-- Main Content Area -->\n            <main class=\"relative z-10 flex-grow flex flex-col items-center pt-24 md:pt-32 pb-20 px-6 md:px-12\">\n\n                <!-- Hero Section -->\n                <div class=\"max-w-3xl text-center flex flex-col items-center\">\n                    <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl tracking-tight font-medium text-[#3A3530] leading-[1.05] masked-reveal\">\n                        Intelligence that scales with your ambition\n                    </h1>\n\n                    <p class=\"mt-8 text-base md:text-lg text-[#68635C] max-w-2xl leading-relaxed gs-fade-up opacity-0 translate-y-4\">\n                        A unified platform designed for complex workflows. Leave disjointed tools behind and give your team a singular cognitive engine that understands the context of your business.\n                    </p>\n\n                    <div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4 gs-fade-up opacity-0 translate-y-4\" style=\"transition-delay: 0.1s;\">\n                        <button class=\"w-full sm:w-auto bg-[#967455] text-white px-7 py-3 text-sm font-medium flex items-center justify-center gap-2 hover:bg-[#856549] transition-all shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] group\">\n                            Explore Nexus\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-lg group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"w-full sm:w-auto border border-[#D4D0C8] bg-transparent text-[#3A3530] px-7 py-3 text-sm font-medium hover:border-[#3A3530] transition-colors\">\n                            View documentation\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Mockup / Visual Area -->\n                <div class=\"w-full mt-24 md:mt-32 relative gs-scale-up opacity-0 scale-95\">\n\n                    <!-- L-brackets for framing -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute -top-4 -left-4 w-4 h-4 border-t border-l border-[#3A3530]/20 z-20\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute -top-4 -right-4 w-4 h-4 border-t border-r border-[#3A3530]/20 z-20\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Inner Container with background image simulating the reference's mountain view -->\n                    <div class=\"w-full aspect-[16/9] max-h-[600px] relative rounded-sm overflow-hidden shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)]\">\n\n                        <!-- Aesthetic Background Image (Aura abstract/landscape style) -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat saturate-50 contrast-125 sepia-[.2]\" style=\"background-image: url('https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/98dc469f-88d8-4fee-8d41-f7d1e581271f_3840w.jpg');\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#F9F8F6]/80 via-[#F9F8F6]/20 to-transparent\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Browser Mockup Window -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[85%] h-[85%] bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md rounded-t-xl shadow-[0_100px_80px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.12)] border border-[#E5E3DD] flex flex-col overflow-hidden transform translate-y-8\">\n\n                            <!-- Browser Header -->\n                            <div class=\"h-12 w-full border-b border-[#F0EFEA] flex items-center px-4 gap-2 bg-white\">\n                                <div class=\"flex gap-1.5\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#E57373]\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#FFF176]\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#81C784]\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Browser Content Wireframe -->\n                            <div class=\"flex-grow p-8 flex flex-col items-center gap-6 opacity-60\">\n                                <!-- Search bar skeleton -->\n                                <div class=\"w-3/4 max-w-md h-10 bg-[#F5F4F1] rounded shadow-inner flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-1/3 h-2 bg-[#E0DED9] rounded-sm\"></div>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <!-- Filters skeleton -->\n                                <div class=\"flex gap-4 w-3/4 max-w-xl justify-center mt-4\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-16 h-4 bg-[#F0EFEA] rounded-sm\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-20 h-4 bg-[#F0EFEA] rounded-sm\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-16 h-4 bg-[#F0EFEA] rounded-sm\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-24 h-4 bg-[#F0EFEA] rounded-sm\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-16 h-4 bg-[#F0EFEA] rounded-sm\"></div>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <!-- Content blocks skeleton -->\n                                <div class=\"w-full max-w-2xl mt-8 flex flex-col gap-4\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-full h-24 bg-[#F9F8F6] rounded border border-[#F0EFEA] flex items-center p-4 gap-4\">\n                                        <div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#EBEAE5] rounded-sm\"></div>\n                                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 flex-grow\">\n                                            <div class=\"w-1/3 h-3 bg-[#EBEAE5] rounded-sm\"></div>\n                                            <div class=\"w-2/3 h-2 bg-[#F0EFEA] rounded-sm\"></div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-full h-24 bg-[#F9F8F6] rounded border border-[#F0EFEA] flex items-center p-4 gap-4\">\n                                        <div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#EBEAE5] rounded-sm\"></div>\n                                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 flex-grow\">\n                                            <div class=\"w-1/4 h-3 bg-[#EBEAE5] rounded-sm\"></div>\n                                            <div class=\"w-1/2 h-2 bg-[#F0EFEA] rounded-sm\"></div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </main>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Scripts for Interaction and Animation -->\n    <script>\n        // --- GSAP Animations ---\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        // 1. Masked Word Reveal for main headline\n        const revealElements = document.querySelectorAll('.masked-reveal');\n\n        revealElements.forEach(el => {\n            // Split text into words, wrap each in overflow-hidden mask\n            const words = el.innerText.trim().split(/\\s+/);\n            el.innerHTML = '';\n\n            words.forEach(word => {\n                const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                wrapper.className = 'masked-word mr-[0.25em]';\n\n                const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                inner.className = 'masked-word-inner';\n                inner.innerText = word;\n\n                wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n                el.appendChild(wrapper);\n            });\n\n            // Animate\n            gsap.to(el.querySelectorAll('.masked-word-inner'), {\n                y: '0%',\n                duration: 1,\n                stagger: 0.04,\n                ease: 'power4.out',\n                delay: 0.1\n            });\n        });\n\n        // 2. Simple fades for secondary content\n        gsap.to('.gs-fade-up', {\n            y: 0,\n            opacity: 1,\n            duration: 1,\n            stagger: 0.1,\n            ease: 'power3.out',\n            delay: 0.6\n        });\n\n        // 3. Mockup scale up\n        gsap.to('.gs-scale-up', {\n            scale: 1,\n            opacity: 1,\n            duration: 1.2,\n            ease: 'expo.out',\n            delay: 0.8\n        });\n\n        // --- WebGL-style Canvas Line Animation ---\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('bg-lines');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n\n        let width, height;\n        let lines = [];\n        let time = 0;\n\n        function resize() {\n            width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n            height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n            initLines();\n        }\n\n        function initLines() {\n            lines = [];\n            // Create topological lines\n            const numLines = Math.floor(height / 15);\n            for (let i = 0; i < numLines; i++) {\n                lines.push({\n                    yBase: i * 15,\n                    offset: Math.random() * 100,\n                    speed: 0.001 + Math.random() * 0.002\n                });\n            }\n        }\n\n        function draw() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n            // Background color base\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#322B25';\n            ctx.fillRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n            ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n            // Warm, rusty earth tone for lines\n            ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(176, 120, 80, 0.15)';\n\n            lines.forEach(line => {\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                for (let x = 0; x <= width; x += 20) {\n                    // Combine sine waves to create noise/topography effect\n                    const noise = Math.sin(x * 0.005 + time * line.speed + line.offset) * 40\n                                + Math.sin(x * 0.01 - time * (line.speed*2)) * 15;\n\n                    const y = line.yBase + noise;\n\n                    if (x === 0) ctx.moveTo(x, y);\n                    else ctx.lineTo(x, y);\n                }\n                ctx.stroke();\n            });\n\n            time += 1;\n            requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n        resize();\n        draw();\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "nexus-intelligence-platform.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nexus-intelligence-platform.jpg", "source_name": "nexus-intelligence-platform-DESIGN.md", "views": 131, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T10:28:51.867362+00:00"}